{"id":"reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia","date":"2026-11-07","topic":"markets","region":"americas","headline":"Three Engineers Started Nvidia at a Diner","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nvidia"},"accent":"ca","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Three engineers met at a diner in 1992.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.8,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":5.25,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.78,1.32,1.58,1.7,2.0,2.38]},{"text":"Jensen Huang, Chris Malachowsky, and Curtis Priem had an idea.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O"],"dur":4.54,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":6.1,"times":[0.0,0.2,1.1,1.54,2.48,2.54,2.84,3.46,3.82,3.94]},{"text":"They wanted to make chips for computer games.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":2.48,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":3.99,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.52,0.66,1.02,1.38,1.78]},{"text":"They named their company Nvidia from a word for envy.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","C","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.56,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":5.54,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.32,0.58,0.88,1.56,2.28,2.42,2.64,2.92]},{"text":"The new business started with forty thousand dollars in 1993.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.28,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.86,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.22,0.56,0.94,1.24,1.56,1.96,2.46,2.8]}],"bands":{"core1000":78,"core1800":3,"ngsl":3,"tsl":3,"nawl":0,"beyond":13},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"to make chips for computer games","title":"Infinitive Phrase as Object","note":"An infinitive phrase starting with 'to' can act as the direct object of verbs like 'want'. It explains what action they wished to perform."},{"i":3,"focus":"named their company Nvidia","title":"Object Complement","note":"The verb 'name' takes both a direct object ('their company') and a complement ('Nvidia'). The complement tells us the name given to the object."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"Three engineers met at a San Jose diner in late 1992.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.32,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":6.47,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.72,1.22,1.44,1.52,1.78,2.06,2.48,2.86,3.08]},{"text":"They wanted to build new chips for computer video games.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.06,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":5.23,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.22,0.46,0.64,0.96,1.34,1.7,2.02,2.36]},{"text":"They wanted one name, but a toilet paper maker owned it.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","S","S","S","S","V","O"],"dur":3.18,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":6.5,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.26,0.64,1.42,1.46,1.56,1.8,2.14,2.42,2.78]},{"text":"So they chose Nvidia because the Latin word invidia means envy.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t2-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.42,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":6.54,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.24,0.5,1.06,1.76,1.96,2.2,2.56,3.28,3.72]},{"text":"They started the company in 1993 with forty thousand dollars.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.14,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.81,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.34,0.54,0.84,1.12,1.9,2.56,2.9,3.34]},{"text":"Investors will later see this small business grow into a tech giant.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","V","O","O","O","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":4.66,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":7.53,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.68,0.94,1.28,1.5,1.8,2.18,2.62,3.06,3.2,3.44]}],"bands":{"core1000":77,"core1800":5,"ngsl":5,"tsl":3,"nawl":0,"beyond":10},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"but","title":"Coordinating Conjunction","note":"The word 'but' connects two independent clauses to highlight a contrast or problem. Here it introduces the conflict regarding ownership of the name."},{"i":3,"focus":"because the Latin word invidia means envy","title":"Adverbial Clause of Reason","note":"The conjunction 'because' introduces a clause explaining the reason behind an action. It tells us why they decided to select the name Nvidia."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"In late 1992, three engineers met at a California diner to plan a company.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t3-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.94,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":7.65,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.44,2.04,2.24,2.74,3.26,3.46,3.54,4.02,4.5,4.88,5.1,5.32]},{"text":"Jensen Huang, Chris Malachowsky, and Curtis Priem wanted to design advanced graphics chips.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.14,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.94,"times":[0.0,0.2,1.16,1.36,2.48,2.64,2.94,3.5,3.92,4.1,4.42,4.7,5.46]},{"text":"To start the firm, Curtis Priem resigned first so his partners would follow him.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t3-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.38,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":6.25,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.26,0.46,1.18,1.36,1.78,2.16,2.52,2.96,3.1,3.4,3.68,3.96]},{"text":"They nearly named the business NVision, which a toilet paper maker already owned.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","C","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.71,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":7.02,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.36,0.74,0.94,1.2,2.42,2.62,2.76,2.94,3.28,3.64,4.1]},{"text":"They selected Nvidia instead, which comes from a Latin word that means envy.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.5,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":6.06,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.46,0.82,2.2,2.34,2.54,2.78,2.88,3.08,3.42,3.64,3.84]},{"text":"The venture has grown from forty thousand dollars into a market giant.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.31,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":4.7,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.54,0.78,1.04,1.4,1.8,2.22,2.7,2.84,3.16]}],"bands":{"core1000":77,"core1800":4,"ngsl":7,"tsl":3,"nawl":0,"beyond":9},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"to plan a company","title":"Infinitive of Purpose","note":"An infinitive can modify a verb by explaining the intention behind the action. It answers why the engineers met at the diner."},{"i":3,"focus":"which a toilet paper maker already owned","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"This clause uses 'which' after a comma to provide extra context about 'NVision'. It adds descriptive details without limiting the identity of the noun."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"In late 1992, three engineers met at a San Jose diner to discuss starting a semiconductor enterprise.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.51,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":10.0,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.46,2.0,2.22,2.7,3.22,3.44,3.52,3.78,4.06,4.48,4.84,5.12,5.58,5.86,6.5]},{"text":"Jensen Huang, Chris Malachowsky, and Curtis Priem envisioned specialized graphics chips to solve complex computing tasks.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.12,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":10.43,"times":[0.0,0.2,1.08,1.28,2.4,2.48,2.76,3.36,4.2,4.66,5.26,5.72,6.1,6.32,6.84,7.34]},{"text":"Priem resigned from his job first, breaking a deadlock between his co-founders and their hesitant wives.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t4-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.96,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":8.72,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.52,0.82,0.98,1.24,2.08,2.36,2.64,3.06,3.42,3.67,4.42,4.64,4.82,5.14]},{"text":"The trio initially considered calling the business NVision, but that name was already registered by another manufacturer.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","V","O","O","O","O","M","S","S","V","M","V","M","M","M"],"dur":6.52,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":8.48,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,0.76,1.38,1.68,1.94,2.2,3.4,3.56,3.72,3.9,4.1,4.5,4.94,5.28,5.56]},{"text":"Specifically, a toilet paper maker owned the trademark, forcing the founders to find an alternative identity.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.12,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":8.99,"times":[0.0,0.0,1.0,1.26,1.62,1.96,2.34,2.5,3.3,3.66,3.9,4.1,4.46,4.7,4.92,5.2]},{"text":"They ultimately settled on Nvidia, a name derived from the Latin word invidia, which translates to envy.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.4,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":9.16,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.46,0.9,1.2,2.26,2.36,2.52,2.76,3.18,3.3,3.5,3.84,4.96,5.04,5.42,5.84]},{"text":"The business was officially launched in April 1993 with forty thousand dollars in initial startup capital.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.47,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.65,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.26,0.52,0.92,1.36,1.62,1.88,2.78,3.52,3.78,4.2,4.62,4.84,5.04,5.46]}],"bands":{"core1000":58,"core1800":10,"ngsl":11,"tsl":7,"nawl":0,"beyond":14},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"breaking a deadlock between his co-founders and their hesitant wives","title":"Participle Adverbial Phrase","note":"A present participle phrase ('-ing') can express an immediate result or accompanying action. Here it explains what was accomplished when Priem resigned first."},{"i":3,"focus":"was already registered","title":"Passive Voice with Adverb","note":"The passive form 'was registered' shows that the subject receives the action. Inserting 'already' emphasizes that registration occurred prior to their idea."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Over meals at a San Jose diner in late 1992, three engineers conceived the original blueprint for Nvidia.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.08,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":10.29,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.6,1.06,1.14,1.34,1.66,2.14,2.52,2.72,4.16,4.54,5.2,5.62,6.08,6.44,6.92,7.44]},{"text":"Jensen Huang, Chris Malachowsky, and Curtis Priem envisioned specialized graphics processing units as the future of 3D gaming and multimedia computing.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t5-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.88,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":11.68,"times":[0.0,0.2,1.2,1.62,2.54,2.54,2.84,3.38,4.12,4.64,5.24,5.94,6.34,6.7,6.84,7.12,7.44,7.88,8.16,8.56,8.92]},{"text":"A domestic stalemate initially delayed their enterprise, as the wives of Huang and Malachowsky hesitated to let them quit simultaneously.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t5-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","M","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.96,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":8.02,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.28,1.06,1.54,1.84,2.24,3.28,3.34,3.46,3.76,4.0,4.22,4.6,5.1,5.8,6.22,6.38,6.52,6.8]},{"text":"Priem broke the deadlock by resigning first, which pressured his co-founders not to leave him to struggle alone.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t5-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.95,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":8.97,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.62,0.8,1.18,1.44,1.94,2.74,2.86,3.14,3.41,4.2,4.44,4.64,4.8,5.0,5.14,5.36]},{"text":"Early name ideas were quickly discarded after the founders realized that NVision was already registered by a toilet paper manufacturer.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t5-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.37,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":9.05,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.44,0.86,1.14,1.4,1.94,2.42,2.62,2.84,3.3,3.76,4.38,4.66,4.72,4.81,4.83,4.85,4.9,4.95]},{"text":"Seeking a fresh brand identity, they chose Nvidia, derived from invidia, the Latin word for envy.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.14,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":7.59,"times":[0.0,0.73,0.91,1.46,2.01,2.92,3.38,3.92,4.65,5.38,5.84,5.92,5.92,5.92,6.0,6.02]},{"text":"Operating out of a townhouse in Fremont, California, they incorporated the enterprise in April 1993 with forty thousand dollars.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t5-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.43,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":7.98,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.56,0.68,0.74,1.24,1.46,2.52,2.96,3.04,3.54,3.78,4.14,4.48,4.7,5.46,6.16,6.4,6.78]},{"text":"Venture capital firms soon backed the young startup with twenty million dollars in early growth funding.","voice":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/t5-7.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.88,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-markets-three-engineers-started-nvidia/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":6.16,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.54,0.94,1.28,1.64,1.86,2.0,2.3,2.68,2.94,3.2,3.6,3.86,4.06,4.36]},{"text":"Spurred